  "description": "The NEW 2023 V2 Land Cruiser is our gravel adventure/fast off-roading frameset built to take you almost anywhere, get you there fast but keep you comfortable for long days in the saddle.\n\nBikepacking ready with triple bottle mounts on the top and downside of the downtube and also two integrated top tube bag mounts.\n\nTyre clearance of 700 x 50mm(2\") or 650b x 2.4\"\n\nThe titanium frame is paired with the Land Cruiser adventure carbon forks which sport triple bottle mounts on the fork legs, internal brake cable routing, internal dynamo cable routing, fender mounts, 100x12mm thru axle and flip chip dropouts offering a 47mm or 52mm offset.\n\nThe finer details include a custom 3D yoke, double butted tubing, CNC machined headtube and bottom bracket, and a mirror polished downtube logo",
